{
  "id": 2067,
  "name": "plaid-tablecloth-r",
  "fling_power": null,
  "fling_effect": null,
  "attributes": [],
  "category": {
    "name": "picnic",
    "url": "/api/v2/item-category/55/"
  },
  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "厚手の生地で　丈夫な　テーブルクロス。落ち着いた赤色の　チェック柄で食卓を　シックに　変身させる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "두꺼운 천으로 만든 튼튼한 테이블보. 차분한 빨간색 체크무늬로 식탁을 세련되게 만들어 준다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "質地厚實，牢固耐用的桌巾。象徵沉著的紅色格紋為餐桌帶來別緻的氣息。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une nappe résistante coupée dans un tissu épais. Le motif rouge à carreaux apaisant apporte de l’élégance à n’importe quelle table.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ein robustes Tischtuch aus dickem Stoff. Mit seinem gesetzten roten Karomuster zaubert es eine gewisse Eleganz auf den Esstisch.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Hecho de un material grueso y resistente, este mantel a cuadros de un estiloso color rojo aporta elegancia a cualquier mesa.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Tovaglia robusta realizzata in tessuto spesso. Il suo motivo a scacchi di un sobrio color rosso trasforma la tavola donandole eleganza.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A sturdy tablecloth made of thick fabric. The quietly composed red plaid gives the table some flair.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "厚手の生地で　丈夫な　テーブルクロス。落ち着いた赤色の　チェック柄で食卓を　シックに　変身させる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "以厚重布料制作的结实桌巾。其沉着稳重的红色格子图案，能让食桌摇身变得优雅别致。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
